{"seq":2,"slug":"gateway-selection","title":"网关选型：Apollo Router vs Hive Gateway","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/implementation/gateway-selection","wordCount":852,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"网关选型-apollo-router-vs-hive-gateway\">网关选型：Apollo Router vs Hive Gateway</h1><p>Federation 架构中，网关是流量的必经之路——它接收所有客户端请求，执行查询规划，协调子图调用并合并响应。2026 年的 Federation 网关生态有两个主要选择：Apollo 官方的 GraphOS Router（Rust 原生）和 The Guild 社区的 Hive Gateway（Node.js，GraphQL Mesh 生态）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>网关在 Federation 中承担查询规划、流量路由、结果合并三重职责。选型决策影响系统的性能天花板、可扩展性和运维复杂度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Apollo Router (GraphOS)</th>\n<th>Hive Gateway (Mesh)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>语言</strong></td>\n<td>Rust（预编译二进制）</td>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Federation 支持</strong></td>\n<td>v2.8 完整</td>\n<td>v2.x 完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>非 GraphQL 源</strong></td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持（REST/gRPC/DB）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>P99 延迟开销</strong></td>\n<td>~7ms</td>\n<td>~45ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>吞吐量</strong></td>\n<td>18k+ req/s</td>\n<td>2.5k req/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>内存基线</strong></td>\n<td>~30MB</td>\n<td>~150MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>扩展方式</strong></td>\n<td>Rhai 脚本 + Native 插件</td>\n<td>JS/TS 插件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>许可证</strong></td>\n<td>ELv2</td>\n<td>MIT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最新版本</strong></td>\n<td>v2.16.0 (2026-06)</td>\n<td>v1.x (2026)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q1{&quot;子图全是 GraphQL?&quot;}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|是| Q2{&quot;需要极致性能?&quot;}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|否,有 REST/gRPC| HG[Hive Gateway]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|是| AR[Apollo Router]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{&quot;需要 JS 插件灵活性?&quot;}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|是| HG&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|否| AR\">graph TD\n    Q1{\"子图全是 GraphQL?\"}\n    Q1 --&gt;|是| Q2{\"需要极致性能?\"}\n    Q1 --&gt;|否,有 REST/gRPC| HG[Hive Gateway]\n    Q2 --&gt;|是| AR[Apollo Router]\n    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{\"需要 JS 插件灵活性?\"}\n    Q3 --&gt;|是| HG\n    Q3 --&gt;|否| AR</pre><h2 id=\"apollo-router-rust-性能王者\">Apollo Router：Rust 性能王者</h2><p>配置驱动，YAML 声明所有行为。对于定制逻辑使用嵌入式 Rhai 脚本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"supergraph:&#10;  listen: 0.0.0.0:4000&#10;headers:&#10;  all:&#10;    request:&#10;      - propagate:&#10;          named: &#39;Authorization&#39;&#10;telemetry:&#10;  exporters:&#10;    tracing:&#10;      otlp:&#10;        endpoint: http://otel-collector:4317\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">supergraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  listen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0:4000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">propagate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          named</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Authorization'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">telemetry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tracing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://otel-collector:4317</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"hive-gateway-混合源灵活性\">Hive Gateway：混合源灵活性</h2><p>通过 GraphQL Mesh source handler 将非 GraphQL 服务接入 supergraph：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { defineConfig, loadGraphQLHTTPSubgraph } from &#39;@graphql-mesh/compose-cli&#39;;&#10;import { loadOpenAPISubgraph } from &#39;@omnigraph/openapi&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const composeConfig = defineConfig({&#10;  subgraphs: [&#10;    { sourceHandler: loadGraphQLHTTPSubgraph(&#39;users&#39;, { endpoint: &#39;http://users:4001/graphql&#39; }) },&#10;    { sourceHandler: loadOpenAPISubgraph(&#39;payments&#39;, { source: &#39;http://payments:3000/openapi.json&#39; }) },&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig, loadGraphQLHTTPSubgraph } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@graphql-mesh/compose-cli'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { loadOpenAPISubgraph } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@omnigraph/openapi'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> composeConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subgraphs: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { sourceHandler: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">loadGraphQLHTTPSubgraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { endpoint: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://users:4001/graphql'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { sourceHandler: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">loadOpenAPISubgraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payments'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { source: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://payments:3000/openapi.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"混合部署方案\">混合部署方案</h2><p>大型组织常用混合部署：mesh-compose 做组合、生产用 Apollo Router 做路由、开发用 Hive Gateway 做快速迭代。supergraph SDL 格式通用，同一份产物两种网关都能消费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态-schema-更新\">动态 Schema 更新</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>更新方式</th>\n<th>Apollo Router</th>\n<th>Hive Gateway</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文件轮询</td>\n<td><code>--hot-reload</code></td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托管推送</td>\n<td>GraphOS 推送</td>\n<td>Hive Cloud</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webhook</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Apollo Router 提供极致性能和配置驱动的确定性</li>\n<li>Hive Gateway 提供混合源联邦和 JS 扩展灵活性</li>\n<li>两者共享 supergraph SDL 格式，可混合使用</li>\n<li>Managed Federation 是生产最佳实践</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"schema-composition\">Schema 组合与 Rover CLI</a>——生成 supergraph SDL 的工程流程</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../devops-tools/api-design/graphql/schema-design\">GraphQL Schema 设计</a>——子图 schema 设计规范</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"apollo-router-高级特性\">Apollo Router 高级特性</h2><p><strong>Native Rust 插件</strong>：对于 Rhai 脚本无法满足的高性能定制需求，Apollo Router 支持编译为 Rust native plugin。典型用例包括自定义认证中间件、请求签名、复杂的 header 变换等。插件通过 Router 的插件 API 注册，运行在同一进程中没有 FFI 开销。</p>\n<p><strong>Coprocessor 模式</strong>：当需要外部服务参与请求处理（如调用 Policy Engine 做鉴权决策）时，Router 支持 Coprocessor——一个通过 HTTP 与 Router 协作的外部进程。Router 在特定生命周期阶段（如 RouterRequest、SubgraphRequest）向 Coprocessor 发送请求上下文，Coprocessor 返回修改后的上下文或拒绝信号。</p>\n<p><strong>Subscription 支持</strong>：Apollo Router 从 v1.x 就支持 GraphQL Subscription，通过 WebSocket 或 HTTP callback 模式将订阅事件从子图传递到客户端。v2.15 添加了 subscription deduplication——相同订阅在 Router 层去重，减少对子图的连接数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hive-gateway-高级特性\">Hive Gateway 高级特性</h2><p><strong>插件系统</strong>：Hive Gateway 使用 Envelop 插件架构，支持请求生命周期中每个阶段的 hook。常用插件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>useAuth()</code> — JWT 验证</li>\n<li><code>useRateLimiter()</code> — 请求级限流</li>\n<li><code>useResponseCache()</code> — 响应级缓存</li>\n<li><code>useMaskedErrors()</code> — 错误信息脱敏</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Schema Transform</strong>：通过 GraphQL Mesh 的 transform 能力，可以在组合时对子图 schema 做修改——重命名类型、过滤字段、添加虚拟字段。这对接入无法修改的第三方 API 特别有用。</p>\n<p><strong>Federation 协议兼容</strong>：Hive Gateway 生成的 supergraph SDL 格式与 Apollo Router 完全兼容。这意味着你可以用 mesh-compose 做组合、输出标准 supergraph SDL、然后用 Apollo Router 做生产路由——享受两个生态的优势。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网关选型：Apollo Router vs Hive Gateway","id":"网关选型-apollo-router-vs-hive-gateway"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Apollo Router：Rust 性能王者","id":"apollo-router-rust-性能王者"},{"level":2,"text":"Hive Gateway：混合源灵活性","id":"hive-gateway-混合源灵活性"},{"level":2,"text":"混合部署方案","id":"混合部署方案"},{"level":2,"text":"动态 Schema 更新","id":"动态-schema-更新"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"Apollo Router 高级特性","id":"apollo-router-高级特性"},{"level":2,"text":"Hive Gateway 高级特性","id":"hive-gateway-高级特性"}],"prev":{"title":"子图开发：多语言实现与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/implementation/subgraph-development"},"next":{"title":"Schema 组合与 Composition 工程流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/implementation/schema-composition"}}